X-Posed
=======

This project ports parts of X-Posed (https://github.com/xaitax/x-account-location-device):
the badge design and colors, the country, alias and region tables, the region memberships
(based on UN M49) and their descriptions, the list of post languages, the icon paths, and the
filter rules with their matching behaviour and help texts. The tables in CountryData.java are
generated from X-Posed 4.4.0 (commit 7e93b04) by tools/generate-country-data.mjs.
